# A planted ledger: a row for the throw, a row for the class, and each import of the planted configuration.  The
# rule judges the imports of each build, so a control of the throws and the classes holds its imports too.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZTIi@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_allocate_exception@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | __cxa_throw@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | throw | admit | admitted_throwing_entry | a planted throw
@build/libfoundation.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_acquire@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_release@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZTVN10__cxxabiv117__class_type_infoE@CXXABI_1.3 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZdlPvm@CXXABI_1.3.9 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | vtable | admit | Admitted | a planted class
